BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cfd5f6da-0d12-5c15-b1e8-02c817913c64
SUMMARY:Online Workshop: Internet Frontiers\, Navigating Data to Inform Public D
 iscourse
DESCRIPTION:Internet Frontiers is a collaborative workshop designed to break down th
 e traditional silos preventing true digital equity in the United States 
 and Canada\n\nParticipants will hear from people across the US and Canad
 a\, including Internet Society chapters\, who are working to close the d
 igital divide\, whether in their local communities or continent-wide. Pa
 nelists will share stories of connecting the unconnected with a focus on
  how data shapes their work.
URL:https://pulse.internetsociety.org/en/events/online-workshop-internet-frontiers-navigating-data-to-inform-public-discourse/
DTSTAMP:20240101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260922
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260922
END:VEVENT
